  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Appraisal of MYNSAM 2.0 framework programme with the Ministry of Environment and its agencies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to appraise and make recommendations for finalizing and for presentation to Council for Development Policy of the pilot 4-year framework programmes of Sector Support Cooperation (SSC), which will be basis for framework agreements between Ministry of Foreign Affairs and Danish sector ministries, agencies and city administrations respectively. The appraisal will overall focus on the framework programme level (as opposed to project-level) guided by the overall appraisal criteria described in the Danida AMG.</narrative>
  </description>
